    <briefdescription>
<para>Cache manager with policy objects and move semantics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 BETA </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Gap Categories: CWE-457 (uninitialized variable), CWE-672 (use-after-free)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Centralized cache policy management</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Move-enabled policy objects</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Event handler callbacks with move semantics</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Multi-cache coordination with moved-from state tracking</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>ThemisDB Cache Module Roadmap: src/cache/ROADMAP.md </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
